{"@context": "http://schema.org", "@id": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.7641588", "@type": "https://schema.org/Dataset", "identifier": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.7641588", "name": "Newick Trees for EMERGE methanogen genome tree, and methylotrophic gene trees", "creator": [{"name": "Jared B. Ellenbogen, Mikayla A. Borton, Kelly C. Wrighton", "familyName": "Jared B. Ellenbogen, Mikayla A. Borton, Kelly C. Wrighton", "affiliation": [{"@type": "Organization", "name": "Colorado State University"}], "@type": "Person"}], "author": [{"name": "Jared B. Ellenbogen, Mikayla A. Borton, Kelly C. Wrighton", "familyName": "Jared B. Ellenbogen, Mikayla A. Borton, Kelly C. Wrighton", "affiliation": [{"@type": "Organization", "name": "Colorado State University"}], "@type": "Person"}], "publisher": {"@type": "Organization", "name": "Zenodo"}, "dateCreated": "2023-02-14T21:36:55.855361+00:00", "dateModified": "2023-04-26T15:21:36.207623+00:00", "datePublished": "2023-02-14", "contentSize": "206.36 KB", "size": "206.36 KB", "license": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/legalcode", "description": "<p>Newick trees provided for phylogenomic and phylogenetic analyses from Ellenbogen&nbsp;<em>et al.&nbsp;</em>(in prep). The methanogen genome tree (<a href=\"https://zenodo.org/api/files/ab7737bc-895d-472d-9db1-363b2868fa1d/Newick_tree_for_methanogen_genome_tree.suptree\">Newick_tree_for_methanogen_genome_tree.suptree</a>) was built using an alignment generated with GTDB-Tk v1.5.0 r202, and the tree&nbsp;made&nbsp;using IQ Tree v1.6.12. All other trees are RAxML gene trees built using ProtPipeliner (<a href=\"https://github.com/TheWrightonLab/Protpipeliner/blob/master/protpipeliner.py\">https://github.com/TheWrightonLab/Protpipeliner/blob/master/protpipeliner.py</a>)&nbsp;to confirm the functional identity of identified methylotrophic genes from methanogens and bacteria. The names of the Newick trees correspond to relevant gene groupings as discussed in the associated manuscript.</p>\n\n<p>FUNDING:<br>\nThis research is a contribution of the EMERGE Biology Integration Institute, funded by the National Science Foundation, Biology Integration Institutes Program, Award # 2022070.<br>\nWe thank the Swedish Polar Research Secretariat and SITES for the support of the work done at the Abisko Scientific Research Station. SITES is supported by the Swedish Research Council&#39;s grant 4.3-2021-00164.<br>\nThis study was also funded by the Genomic Science Program of the United States Department of Energy Office of Biological and Environmental Research, grant #s DE-SC0010580 and DE-SC0016440.</p>", "url": "https://zenodo.org/records/7641588", "distribution": [{"@type": "DataDownload", "contentUrl": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/7641588/files/Newick_tree_for_methanogen_genome_tree.suptree/content", "encodingFormat": "application/octet-stream"}, {"@type": "DataDownload", "contentUrl": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/7641588/files/Newick_tree_MtxB_methylO_homologs/content", "encodingFormat": "application/octet-stream"}, {"@type": "DataDownload", "contentUrl": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/7641588/files/Newick_tree_Corrinoid_homologs/content", "encodingFormat": "application/octet-stream"}, {"@type": "DataDownload", "contentUrl": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/7641588/files/Newick_tree_MtxA_homologs/content", "encodingFormat": "application/octet-stream"}, {"@type": "DataDownload", "contentUrl": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/7641588/files/Newick_tree_sulfur_gene_homologs/content", "encodingFormat": "application/octet-stream"}, {"@type": "DataDownload", "contentUrl": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/7641588/files/Newick_tree_bacterial_MtxB_homologs_top_3_phyla/content", "encodingFormat": "application/octet-stream"}, {"@type": "DataDownload", "contentUrl": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/7641588/files/Newick_tree_Ram_homologs/content", "encodingFormat": "application/octet-stream"}]}